","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogerGodzilla/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogerGodzilla/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogerGodzilla/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogerGodzilla/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogerGodzilla/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogerGodzilla/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogerGodzilla/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RogerGodzilla/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-09T06:44:15Z","updated_at":"2026-05-09T06:44:15Z","body":"Better late than never, I suppose.\n\nI ran the script below to get the output shown\n\n```godot\n        print(Input.get_connected_joypads())\n\tfor i in range(len(Input.get_connected_joypads())):\n\t\tprint(\"input: \" + str(i))\n\t\tprint(Input.get_joy_name(i))\n\t\tprint(Input.get_joy_info(i))\n\t\tprint(\"-----\")\n\tprint(Input.is_action_pressed(\"ui_up\"))\n\tprint(Input.is_action_pressed(\"ui_left\"))\n\tprint(\"=============\")\n```\n\nwith the tablet plugged in and not touching the window:\n\n```\n[0, 1, 2, 3]\ninput: 0\nLogitech F310\n{ \"raw_name\": \"Logitech Gamepad F310\", \"vendor_id\": \"1133\", \"product_id\": \"49693\", \"xinput_index\": \"0\" }\n-----\ninput: 1\nHuion Tablet_GS1331\n{ \"raw_name\": \"Huion Tablet_GS1331\", \"vendor_id\": \"9580\", \"product_id\": \"109\" }\n-----\ninput: 2\nHuion Tablet_GS1331 Touch Strip\n{ \"raw_name\": \"Huion Tablet_GS1331 Touch Strip\", \"vendor_id\": \"9580\", \"product_id\": \"109\" }\n-----\ninput: 3\nKeychron K10 Pro System Control\n{ \"raw_name\": \"Keychron K10 Pro System Control\", \"vendor_id\": \"13364\", \"product_id\": \"672\" }\n-----\nfalse\nfalse\n=============\n```\n\nmoving the window changes the output to this:\n\n```\n[0, 1, 2, 3]\ninput: 0\nLogitech F310\n{ \"raw_name\": \"Logitech Gamepad F310\", \"vendor_id\": \"1133\", \"product_id\": \"49693\", \"xinput_index\": \"0\" }\n-----\ninput: 1\nHuion Tablet_GS1331\n{ \"raw_name\": \"Huion Tablet_GS1331\", \"vendor_id\": \"9580\", \"product_id\": \"109\" }\n-----\ninput: 2\nHuion Tablet_GS1331 Touch Strip\n{ \"raw_name\": \"Huion Tablet_GS1331 Touch Strip\", \"vendor_id\": \"9580\", \"product_id\": \"109\" }\n-----\ninput: 3\nKeychron K10 Pro System Control\n{ \"raw_name\": \"Keychron K10 Pro System Control\", \"vendor_id\": \"13364\", \"product_id\": \"672\" }\n-----\nfalse\nfalse\n=============\n```\n\nand unplugging the tablet gives the following (without moving the window)\n\n```\n[0, 1]\ninput: 0\nLogitech F310\n{ \"raw_name\": \"Logitech Gamepad F310\", \"vendor_id\": \"1133\", \"product_id\": \"49693\", \"xinput_index\": \"0\" }\n-----\ninput: 1\nKeychron K10 Pro System Control\n{ \"raw_name\": \"Keychron K10 Pro System Control\", \"vendor_id\": \"13364\", \"product_id\": \"672\" }\n-----\nfalse\nfalse\n=============\n```\n\nPlease let me know if there is any more info you would like to have!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4411757099/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4411788884","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119302#issuecomment-4411788884","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119302","id":4411788884,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBvaOVA","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/fo